1) Camunda
    Camunda is a tool where you create workflows (using BPMN) and decision rules (using DMN), and it executes them by calling your code, APIs, and services.
                                                            or
    Camunda is an open‑source workflow and decision automation platform that helps you model, run, and automate business processes using BPMN, DMN, and CMMN standards.
